MODULE: SaturatedLatencyOneTickRecoveryWindowDelaysSaturate
TARGET: SaturatedLatencyOneTick
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: recovery hysteresis wrongly delays the rising acute edge
PERTURBS: Sample

--- FIND
    /\ treeVerdict' = [t \in Trees |-> TreeValue(t)]
--- REPLACE
